  "keyFeatures": [
    "Real-time shared bookmark list — all visitors see the same data",
    "Folder organization with emoji, color, and pin support",
    "Command palette (⌘K) for instant link search and navigation",
    "Click tracking, favorites, and Most Visited quick-bar",
    "Tag-based filtering and multiple sort modes",
    "Admin panel with password protection for editing/deleting",
    "Import/export bookmarks as JSON or Netscape HTML",
    "Dark and light theme support",
    "Upstash Redis backend with automatic safe-guard against accidental data loss",
    "Deployable to Vercel with zero configuration beyond env vars"
  ],
